---
title: "Support & FAQ"
description: "Get help with your account, PDF tools, and OnlinePDFPro. Contact support."
keywords: "onlinepdfpro support, help, faq, contact, account help"
permalink: /support.html
bodyClass: hp-body
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}
{% block head %}
<style>
.support-page { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 120px 24px 80px; }
.support-heading { font-family: var(--hp-serif, 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.support-heading em { font-style: italic; }
.support-subtitle { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--hp-text-secondary, #6b5e4f); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 48px; }
.support-section { margin-bottom: 48px; }
.support-section-title { font-family: var(--hp-serif, 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif); font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 20px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hp-border, #d9d0c3); }
.faq-item { margin-bottom: 16px; }
.faq-q { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.faq-a { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--hp-text-secondary, #6b5e4f); line-height: 1.7; }
.support-contact { background: var(--hp-bg-alt, #efe9de); padding: 32px; margin-top: 48px; }
.support-contact h3 { font-family: var(--hp-serif, 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.support-contact p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--hp-text-secondary, #6b5e4f); line-height: 1.7; }
.support-contact a { color: var(--hp-accent, #8b6914); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
.support-contact a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<div class="support-page">
    <h1 class="support-heading">Support & <em>FAQ</em></h1>
    <p class="support-subtitle">Find answers to common questions about your account and our free PDF tools.</p>

    <div class="support-section">
        <h2 class="support-section-title">Account</h2>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <p class="faq-q">How do I sign in?</p>
            <p class="faq-a">You can sign in with your email and password, or use Google Sign-In for one-click access. An account is only required when purchasing study materials.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <p class="faq-q">How does Google login work?</p>
            <p class="faq-a">Click "Continue with Google" on the login page. We use Supabase Auth with Google OAuth — your name and profile photo are imported automatically. No extra password needed.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <p class="faq-q">I need to reset my password</p>
            <p class="faq-a">Password reset functionality is coming soon. If you signed up with Google, simply use "Continue with Google" instead. For urgent account issues, email us at support@onlinepdfpro.com.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="support-section">
        <h2 class="support-section-title">Study Materials</h2>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <p class="faq-q">Can I buy study materials?</p>
            <p class="faq-a">Study material purchases are currently being prepared. Paid checkout will be available soon. You can browse our catalogue and create an account in the meantime.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <p class="faq-q">What payment methods will be supported?</p>
            <p class="faq-a">We are integrating a secure payment processor. Payment options including UPI, cards, and net banking will be available when checkout launches.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="support-section">
        <h2 class="support-section-title">PDF Tools</h2>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <p class="faq-q">Are the PDF tools really free?</p>
            <p class="faq-a">Yes. All 30+ PDF tools (merge, compress, split, sign, convert, etc.) are completely free with no watermarks, no limits, and no account required.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <p class="faq-q">Are my files uploaded to a server?</p>
            <p class="faq-a">Most tools process your files entirely in your browser — your documents never leave your device. Some AI-powered tools (like Chat with PDF) may send data to an API for processing, which is clearly noted on those tool pages.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="support-contact">
        <h3>Still need help?</h3>
        <p>Email us at <a href="mailto:support@onlinepdfpro.com">support@onlinepdfpro.com</a> and we'll get back to you within 24 hours.</p>
    </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
